# Operating modules

Each context is one folder under `.ai/modules/<id>/`. Read that folder's `SKILL.md` before acting in the context.

- `.ai/modules/costar/SKILL.md`
- `.ai/modules/canon/SKILL.md`
- `.ai/modules/plans/SKILL.md`
- `.ai/modules/chats/SKILL.md`
- `.ai/modules/journal/SKILL.md`
- `.ai/modules/roadmap/SKILL.md`

File chats with `.ai/machine/copy_chats.py`. Check every module with `.ai/machine/organize.py --check`.
